{"unit_id":"Jxxxxx729__dsh-win-notify#card-zh","repo":"Jxxxxx729/dsh-win-notify","commit":"d085a0f20b9866d3910d3d21c53bc257ef33618a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-win-notify 是面向 Windows 的 DSH 通知插件，在桌面端监听对话完成或异常、等待选择、等待授权及登录状态事件，并通过 Windows Toast 提醒用户。它注册自定义协议，用户点击通知后可聚焦 DSH 并返回对应会话；Web 客户端通过本机同源路由取得点击记录并打开会话。适合希望离开窗口时及时收到会话状态提醒的 DSH 用户，需要 Windows 10/11 桌面端及系统自带组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:436","index.js:772","client.js:100"]}
{"unit_id":"Jxxxxx729__dsh-win-notify#card-en","repo":"Jxxxxx729/dsh-win-notify","commit":"d085a0f20b9866d3910d3d21c53bc257ef33618a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-win-notify sends Windows alerts for DSH turn endings, questions, approvals, and sign-in events. Clicking a toast focuses DSH and opens the session through a local route and web client. It suits users who want updates while away; Windows 10/11 and the DSH desktop app are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:436","index.js:772","client.js:100"]}
